            "content": "## Gateway assumptions\n\n- Make API Call posts to `/hooks/appmixer-echo` without a callback URL: that hook then starts nothing and the gateway answers **204**.\n- Run Agent starts a real, short turn of agent **maya** on Haiku with no announcement: `maya` must be in `hooks.allowedAgentIds` and the Haiku model allowed by the gateway model policy."
